WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Four pictures of yesterday's robot go into one video model.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.500
It films harvest day, with its own sound.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.500
A second model turns the same clip into depth.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.550
Close things are white, far things are dark, in every frame.
